Tectonic v{version}

  1) community/browser  A browser, from the second collection (requires flatpak)
  2) upstream/browser  A browser, from the first collection
  3) upstream/custom-kernel  A kernel the image pins, swapped in over the base's own
  4) upstream/debian-family  apt and its state directories, which every deb build layer reaches for
  5) upstream/fedora-family  dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for
  6) upstream/flatpak  Flatpak client and a daily update timer
  7) upstream/needs-family  A module that needs the family adapter under it (requires build-environment)
  8) upstream/signature-policy  Sigstore signature verification for the image's own updates
Which modules? [1-8, several, 0 for none]: 1 3

List it in example? (Yes/No)
Yes

The selected modules have dependencies not currently provided by the images:

  browser > fedora-bootc:44
    requires: flatpak
    provider module: flatpak

Add these provider modules now? (Yes/No)
Yes

`kernel-freshness` tracks the kernel a module pins, and proposes a bump

Generate the workflows this makes runnable? (Yes/No)
Yes


example/
├── ~ example.image.kdl  flatpak, browser and custom-kernel added to modules
└── ~ repo.kdl  the workflows it generates
